===== 3. clean up the nonce account =====
  left in place deliberately. To close it and recover the rent:

    solana nonce-account withdraw A7qseu8Hp7DED5LV3pcsWWXh3ewEXYg7DULCmvYnuteF 25TUohqYd5b6f97wc5CjMwj89ZVL8oX81nhkWVHimYpY \
      --url https://api.devnet.solana.com --fee-payer \\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\dell2u\.config\solana\id.json

  rent held      1500000 lamports

===== what this shows =====
  Both transactions are real durable-nonce transactions: the blockhash is the
  stored nonce and the first instruction advances it. The only difference is the
  retention. Finite retention is refused with DurableNonceUnsupported; permanent
  is allowed. The policy holds against a live cluster, not just against an
  injected marker in a harness.
